O=NaN                  -> RAISED InvalidOperation: [<class 'decimal.InvalidOperation'>]
H=NaN                  -> RAISED InvalidOperation: [<class 'decimal.InvalidOperation'>]
L=NaN                  -> RAISED InvalidOperation: [<class 'decimal.InvalidOperation'>]
V=NaN                  -> state=VALID class=Q1
