tick_size=NaN          -> state=VALID class=Q1
quantity_step=NaN      -> state=VALID class=Q1
C=+Inf                 -> RAISED InvalidOperation: [<class 'decimal.InvalidOperation'>]
H=+Inf                 -> RAISED InvalidOperation: [<class 'decimal.InvalidOperation'>]
